            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A brief history of pain, its pathophysiology, and management is provided. This primer on pain which is written for the consumer describes how pain is diagnosed, the role of gender and age, a discussion of future directions in pain research, ad includes an appendix that defines pain terms and concepts.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
